## Handoff checkpoint

Use only when unfinished work crosses sessions/tools; otherwise remove this section. Record the actual state at handoff, not a continuous activity log.

```text
Goal and acceptance criteria:
Branch and base commit:
Modified files and uncommitted work:
Decisions already made:
Checks run and results:
Remaining work or blockers:
Next concrete action:
```

Include relevant constraints and existing approvals. In the next session, read project instructions and verify the actual branch, commit, and working tree. Notes do not transfer uncommitted code; supply the actual changes to another checkout through a maintainer-controlled patch or authorized Git action.

